## Memory

The most memory each run held, from the kernel's accounting of the process. One zanity run covers every rule, where the same coverage takes all five tools: run side by side, as in a pre-commit hook, they hold 691 MB at once.

```=html
<figure class="chart"><figcaption>Peak memory checking the corpus, smaller is better</figcaption>
<div class="chart-row other"><span class="chart-label">nasa-lsp</span><span class="chart-track"><span class="chart-bar" style="width:7.7%"></span><span class="chart-value">63 MB</span></span></div>
<div class="chart-row other"><span class="chart-label">testdesiderata</span><span class="chart-track"><span class="chart-bar" style="width:4.3%"></span><span class="chart-value">35 MB</span></span></div>
<div class="chart-row other"><span class="chart-label">mockbuster</span><span class="chart-track"><span class="chart-bar" style="width:4.0%"></span><span class="chart-value">33 MB</span></span></div>
<div class="chart-row other"><span class="chart-label">dddlint</span><span class="chart-track"><span class="chart-bar" style="width:9.2%"></span><span class="chart-value">75 MB</span></span></div>
<div class="chart-row other"><span class="chart-label">bonsai</span><span class="chart-track"><span class="chart-bar" style="width:59.8%"></span><span class="chart-value">486 MB</span></span></div>
<div class="chart-row other"><span class="chart-label">all five at once</span><span class="chart-track"><span class="chart-bar" style="width:85.0%"></span><span class="chart-value">691 MB</span></span></div>
<div class="chart-row zanity"><span class="chart-label">zanity, cold</span><span class="chart-track"><span class="chart-bar" style="width:14.6%"></span><span class="chart-value">119 MB</span></span></div>
</figure>
```

## Every command

The tools ran through the same adapters as above. Cold zanity starts each run with an empty cache; warm reuses the last run's.

| Command | Mean | ± | Fastest | Peak memory | Against zanity, all rules, cold |
| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| nasa-lsp | 984 ms | 16 ms | 961 ms | 63 MB | 4.5× |
| testdesiderata | 1.31 s | 22 ms | 1.30 s | 35 MB | 6.0× |
| mockbuster | 441 ms | 2 ms | 438 ms | 33 MB | 2.0× |
| dddlint | 793 ms | 57 ms | 722 ms | 75 MB | 3.6× |
| bonsai | 23.55 s | 1.21 s | 22.66 s | 486 MB | 107.0× |
| zanity, nasa-lsp rules, cold | 201 ms | 2 ms | 199 ms | 106 MB | 0.9× |
| zanity, testdesiderata rules, cold | 197 ms | 3 ms | 193 ms | 106 MB | 0.9× |
| zanity, mockbuster rules, cold | 186 ms | 3 ms | 181 ms | 103 MB | 0.8× |
| zanity, dddlint rules, cold | 196 ms | 9 ms | 188 ms | 104 MB | 0.9× |
| zanity, bonsai rules, cold | 205 ms | 5 ms | 198 ms | 113 MB | 0.9× |
| zanity, mapped rules, cold | 225 ms | 18 ms | 208 ms | 118 MB | 1.0× |
| zanity, mapped rules, warm | 141 ms | 6 ms | 136 ms | 67 MB | 0.6× |
| zanity, all rules, cold | 220 ms | 5 ms | 214 ms | 119 MB | 1.0× |
| zanity, all rules, warm | 175 ms | 42 ms | 149 ms | 67 MB | 0.8× |

# Editors and watch mode

## As language servers, and watching

rich's `console.py`, 2,698 lines, alone in a workspace; the median of 5. First: from starting the server to diagnostics for the opened file. Save: from a change and save to fresh diagnostics. Memory: what the process held with the file open; an editor runs every language server at once, so the others' memory adds up. `zanity check --watch` listens to the system's file events outside any editor and keeps its workspace and parsed-file cache alive between checks. nouls' server needs `TYPESAFE_API_KEY` and did not run.

```=html
<figure class="chart"><figcaption>Start to first diagnostics, shorter is better</figcaption>
<div class="chart-row other"><span class="chart-label">nasa-lsp</span><span class="chart-track"><span class="chart-bar" style="width:10.7%"></span><span class="chart-value">280 ms</span></span></div>
<div class="chart-row other"><span class="chart-label">dddlint</span><span class="chart-track"><span class="chart-bar" style="width:20.0%"></span><span class="chart-value">524 ms</span></span></div>
<div class="chart-row other"><span class="chart-label">bonsai</span><span class="chart-track"><span class="chart-bar" style="width:85.0%"></span><span class="chart-value">2.23 s</span></span></div>
<div class="chart-row zanity"><span class="chart-label">zanity</span><span class="chart-track"><span class="chart-bar" style="width:5.9%"></span><span class="chart-value">154 ms</span></span></div>
<div class="chart-row zanity"><span class="chart-label">zanity check --watch</span><span class="chart-track"><span class="chart-bar" style="width:5.5%"></span><span class="chart-value">144 ms</span></span></div>
</figure>
```

```=html
<figure class="chart"><figcaption>Save to fresh diagnostics, shorter is better</figcaption>
<div class="chart-row other"><span class="chart-label">nasa-lsp</span><span class="chart-track"><span class="chart-bar" style="width:3.1%"></span><span class="chart-value">60 ms</span></span></div>
<div class="chart-row other"><span class="chart-label">dddlint</span><span class="chart-track"><span class="chart-bar" style="width:2.4%"></span><span class="chart-value">46 ms</span></span></div>
<div class="chart-row other"><span class="chart-label">bonsai</span><span class="chart-track"><span class="chart-bar" style="width:85.0%"></span><span class="chart-value">1.66 s</span></span></div>
<div class="chart-row zanity"><span class="chart-label">zanity</span><span class="chart-track"><span class="chart-bar" style="width:7.6%"></span><span class="chart-value">149 ms</span></span></div>
<div class="chart-row zanity"><span class="chart-label">zanity check --watch</span><span class="chart-track"><span class="chart-bar" style="width:3.7%"></span><span class="chart-value">73 ms</span></span></div>
</figure>
```

```=html
<figure class="chart"><figcaption>Memory with the file open, smaller is better</figcaption>
<div class="chart-row other"><span class="chart-label">nasa-lsp</span><span class="chart-track"><span class="chart-bar" style="width:17.9%"></span><span class="chart-value">47 MB</span></span></div>
<div class="chart-row other"><span class="chart-label">dddlint</span><span class="chart-track"><span class="chart-bar" style="width:22.9%"></span><span class="chart-value">61 MB</span></span></div>
<div class="chart-row other"><span class="chart-label">bonsai</span><span class="chart-track"><span class="chart-bar" style="width:44.2%"></span><span class="chart-value">117 MB</span></span></div>
<div class="chart-row zanity"><span class="chart-label">zanity</span><span class="chart-track"><span class="chart-bar" style="width:13.7%"></span><span class="chart-value">36 MB</span></span></div>
